# TOEIC Part 5 — Day46

## Q1

_____ in 1995, the museum attracts thousands of visitors every year.

(A) Establishing
(B) Established
(C) Establish
(D) Establishment

**정답: B**

→ 박물관이 설립된 것

> Established in 1995,...

